    "subject": "Reviewed civic complaint CMP-20260522-K1RL: Water Supply Issue",
    "message": "Tracking ID: CMP-20260522-K1RL\nTitle: Water Supply Issue\nCategory: Water Supply\nPriority: Medium\nSubmitted On: 2026-05-22 07:45\n\nDescription:\nThe water supply in our area has completely dried up, and I am struggling to access even a basic necessity. As you can see from the attached image, the land is completely parched and cracked, and I am finding it extremely difficult to get water for my daily needs.\n\nLocation:\nAddress: Ernakulam\nCoordinates: 9.997699, 76.285509\n\nAttached image links:\n/media/complaints/images/2026/05/download_5TlPcRB.jpg\n\nDepartment triage remarks:\nsent to authority",
    "remarks": "sent to authority",
    "status": "sent",
    "error_message": null,
    "sent_at": "2026-05-24T09:53:31.632Z",
    "created_at": "2026-05-24T09:53:30.174Z"
  }
},
