    "subject": "Reviewed civic complaint CMP-20260521-ZHOQ: Pothole with Water on Road Surface",
    "message": "Tracking ID: CMP-20260521-ZHOQ\nTitle: Pothole with Water on Road Surface\nCategory: Road & Pothole\nPriority: Critical\nSubmitted On: 2026-05-21 21:16\n\nDescription:\nThere is a large pothole on the road surface that is filled with water, creating a hazard for drivers and pedestrians. The pothole is located on a main road, and its presence, especially with the water accumulation, poses a risk of accidents and damage to vehicles.\n\nLocation:\nAddress: Kakkanad\nCoordinates: 10.055035, 76.321922\n\nAttached image links:\n/media/complaints/images/2026/05/download_ujBBVZO.jpg\n\nDepartment triage remarks:\nsend to authority",
