    "subject": "Reviewed civic complaint CMP-20260522-E0WD: Residential Flooding Issue Reported",
    "message": "Tracking ID: CMP-20260522-E0WD\nTitle: Residential Flooding Issue Reported\nCategory: Drainage & Sewage\nPriority: Critical\nSubmitted On: 2026-05-22 07:49\n\nDescription:\nThe residential area is experiencing severe flooding, with water covering the streets and reaching the bottom of a car parked on the road. The flooding issue seems to be caused by inadequate drainage, and I am concerned about the potential risks to property and public health.\n\nLocation:\nAddress: Ernakulam\nCoordinates: 9.997696, 76.285512\n\nAttached image links:\n/media/complaints/images/2026/05/download_0qcPuaB.jpg\n\nDepartment triage remarks:\nsend complaint to authority",
