    "message": "Tracking ID: CMP-20260518-UBXR\nTitle: Pothole Repair Needed\nCategory: Road & Pothole\nPriority: Medium\nSubmitted On: 2026-05-18 09:41\n\nDescription:\nThere is a large pothole on the road that needs to be repaired, as it poses a hazard to drivers and cyclists. The road appears to be in a state of disrepair, with visible cracks and uneven surfaces, and the pothole in question is particularly deep and wide, requiring immediate attention.\n\nLocation:\nCoordinates: 9.997680, 76.285519\n\nAttached image links:\n/media/complaints/images/2026/05/download_5BZTreH.jpg\n\nDepartment triage remarks:\nhi",
